[[Image:Is conjure.gif|right|Conjuration]]

Spells from the '''conjuration''' [[spell school]] can bring creatures to the caster, normally in the form of summoned allies.
This is also the school with the primary curative spells, including the spells that cure death.

'''Prohibited school:''' [[transmutation]]<br />
'''Prohibited to:''' abjurers, evokers, and transmuters

== Spells ==

The conjuration spells are the following, organized by [[innate level]]. 
Since [[wizard]]s have a greater interest in spell schools than other classes (because they can specialize in a school), spells that are not wizard spells are ''in italics''.

